    "Description": "## Impact\n\nAn attacker-controlled, allow-listed remote URL can lead to server-side request forgery (e.g. to private IPs) during Image Optimization. \n\n## Workaround\n\nAudit allow-listed remote URLs in `images.remotePatterns` (see https://nextjs.org/docs/app/getting-started/images#remote-images) for hosts that may not be trusted with their DNS entries. If no `images.remotePatterns` are configured, your app is not affected.",
